  <main class="world-route" id="main">
    <div class="world-route-heading wrap" id="top"><div><a class="world-back-link" href="/">← Back to the portfolio</a><p class="eyebrow">A different way to look around</p><h1>The work has<br /><em>a little world.</em></h1></div><p>A studio, an engine room, a memory observatory. Six connected places for the projects and the tools behind them.</p></div>
    <div class="world-route-body"><ForgeWorld /></div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
